WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,170
Sorry An Ran

2
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,780
i love you

3
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,940
She thinks of me as another woman, right?

4
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:07,930
That forehead has a scar

5
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:09,730
saying the same thing

6
